# Regenerable deck-render artifacts (genspark-branded-deck / pptx pipelines).
# The reproducible inputs stay tracked — slides/, chrome.css, deck.html, the
# build scripts, fonts/ and the final .pptx — plus build/qa/, which the
# officecli-qa skill names as required passing evidence. These three are pure
# output: `render.mjs` and `render_hybrid.mjs` regenerate them in minutes, and
# they were ~50MB per session.
runs/**/build/png/
runs/**/build/bg/
runs/**/build/pos/
